  "disclaimer": "本文件只是候选参考稿，不是本项目的正式 L0 原文。只有主编对照底本实物签字之后，才能把对应条目录入 inputs/human/55-feng-canonical.csv，由 gxwd texts import 写入 data/canonical-texts.json。",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text_id": "H55-gua_ci",
      "text_type": "gua_ci",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "丰：亨，王假之。勿忧，宜日中。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-tuan",
      "text_type": "tuan",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "丰，大也。明以动，故丰。王假之，尚大也。勿忧，宜日中，宜照天下也。日中则昃，月盈则食，天地盈虚，与时消息，而况于人乎？况于鬼神乎？",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-da_xiang",
      "text_type": "da_xiang",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "雷电皆至，丰。君子以折狱致刑。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-yao_ci-L1",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 1,
      "line_name": "初九",
      "candidate_text": "遇其配主，虽旬无咎，往有尚。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-yao_ci-L2",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 2,
      "line_name": "六二",
      "candidate_text": "丰其蔀，日中见斗，往得疑疾。有孚发若，吉。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-yao_ci-L3",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 3,
      "line_name": "九三",
      "candidate_text": "丰其沛，日中见沬，折其右肱，无咎。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-yao_ci-L4",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 4,
      "line_name": "九四",
      "candidate_text": "丰其蔀，日中见斗，遇其夷主，吉。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-yao_ci-L5",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 5,
      "line_name": "六五",
      "candidate_text": "来章，有庆誉，吉。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-yao_ci-L6",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 6,
      "line_name": "上六",
      "candidate_text": "丰其屋，蔀其家，窥其户，阒其无人，三岁不觌，凶。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-xiao_xiang-L1",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 1,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“虽旬无咎”，过旬灾也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-xiao_xiang-L2",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 2,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“有孚发若”，信以发志也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-xiao_xiang-L3",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 3,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“丰其沛”，不可大事也；“折其右肱”，终不可用也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-xiao_xiang-L4",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 4,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“丰其蔀”，位不当也；“日中见斗”，幽不明也；“遇其夷主”，吉行也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-xiao_xiang-L5",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 5,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "六五之吉，有庆也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H55-xiao_xiang-L6",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 6,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“丰其屋”，天际翔也；“窥其户，阒其无人”，自藏也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    }
  ]
}
